{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% set theme = "sovereign" %}
{% set kicker = "// CANARY DETECTED SUPPLY DELTA" %}
{% set headline = "Canary Fire Produced Supply Imbalance" %}
{% block body %}
<p>A canary synthetic transfer triggered a supply invariant deviation. The canary system fires real production transfers between dedicated system agents. When the cross-frame ledger snapshot before vs after a fire shows non-zero Δ, it indicates a correctness regression in the transfer pipeline.</p>
{% with rows=[
  ('Frame', frame),
  ('Delta', delta),
  ('Path', path),
  ('Backend', backend),
  ('Test ID', test_id),
  ('Sender', sender_did),
  ('Receiver', receiver_did),
  ('Detected at', detected_at)
] %}{% include '_partials/data_table.html' %}{% endwith %}
{% with cta_url=registry_ui_url ~ '#/admin', cta_label="OPEN ADMIN CONSOLE" %}{% include '_partials/cta_button.html' %}{% endwith %}
{% with notice="A canary-detected delta is more actionable than the projection-based supply auditor: the canary knows EXACTLY which transfer caused the divergence. Cross-reference with the EventStore events for the test_id above, then with the auditor's snapshot." %}{% include '_partials/info_box.html' %}{% endwith %}
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;">CLI: <code>docker exec agentvault_event_store_db psql -U postgres -d eventstore -c "SELECT event_type, source_service, timestamp FROM events WHERE event_data::text LIKE '%{{ test_id }}%' ORDER BY timestamp"</code></p>
{% endblock %}
